OL,3,GNEWSAUnder 15 bus travel ban is unfair,
OL,4,Acouncillor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ban on children under 15 travelling
OL,7,Falone on buses in the evening is
OL,8,Funfair, a councillor has said.
OL,10,FFinlay Gordon-McCusker, cabinet member
OL,11,Ffor transport at Stoke-on-Trent City
OL,12,FCouncil, spoke after First Bus said
OL,13,Fyoung people would have to be
OL,14,Faccompanied by an adult when travelling
OL,15,Fon services to and from Hanley Bus
OL,16,FStation after 18:00.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
