OL,3,GNEWSAUnder 15 bus travel ban is unfair,
OL,4,Acouncillor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever a bus driver for the firm
OL,7,Fclaimed free travel for young people
OL,8,Fhas been treated like childcare.
OL,9,FChildren aged five to 15 are able to
OL,10,Ftravel on most bus services in England
OL,11,Ffor free, until the end of the month.
OL,13,FBus driver Ian from Penkhull said in
OL,14,Fhis 30 years he had seen more children
OL,15,Fusing the buses now as a result of the
OL,16,Foffer.
